  // Shown when the open chat changed while a preset action ran, or before an action on a panel drawn for another chat.
  const PRESET_CHAT_SWITCHED = '聊天已切换；上一个聊天的预设内容不再显示，这次操作没有执行或其结果已丢弃。请在当前聊天重新读取。';
